{"id":"prestes","lemma":"prestes","pos":"adj","rank":855,"glosses":["ready, prepared","imminent, near in time","quick, fast"],"ipa":"/ˈpɾɛʃ.tɨʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-prestes.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-prestes.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"O jogo está prestes a começar.","en":"The game is about to start.","words":[null,null,{"g":"is","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to start"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"The Game"]]},{"text":"Estávamos prestes a entrar no quarto.","en":"We were just about to enter the room.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to enter"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"quarter"}]},{"text":"Ela estava prestes a se matar.","en":"She was on the verge of killing herself.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to kill"}]},{"text":"Eles estão prestes a ir.","en":"They're about to go.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Estou prestes a morrer.","en":"I'm about to die.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to die"}]}]}